    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="header-actions">
    <button class="icon-btn" id="soundBtn" onclick="toggleSound()" title="Suara"><i class="fas fa-volume-up"></i></button>
    <button class="icon-btn" onclick="toggleTheme()" id="themeBtn" title="Tema"><i class="fas fa-sun"></i></button>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="toast-wrap" id="toastWrap"></div>

<main class="wrap">

  <section class="start-screen" id="startScreen">
    <span class="hero-badge"><i class="fas fa-crown"></i> PREMIUM GAME MODE · LEVEL 16</span>
    <h1 class="hero-title">Teori Masuk<br>&amp; Kerajaan Awal</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">
      Kuasai <strong>4 teori masuknya Hindu-Buddha</strong> (Ksatria, Brahmana, Waisya, Arus Balik) dan <strong>kerajaan Hindu awal</strong> — Kutai &amp; Tarumanegara — beserta bukti prasastinya!
    </p>

    <div class="stats-showcase">
      <span class="stat-pill" style="color:#FCD34D"><i class="fas fa-question-circle"></i> 15 Soal Acak</span>
      <span class="stat-pill" style="color:#93C5FD"><i class="fas fa-stopwatch"></i> 20 Menit</span>
      <span class="stat-pill" style="color:#FB7185"><i class="fas fa-heart"></i> 3 Nyawa</span>
      <span class="stat-pill" style="color:#34D399"><i class="fas fa-bolt"></i> Combo &amp; XP</span>
    </div>

    <div class="rules-card">
      <h4><i class="fas fa-list-check"></i> Cara Bermain</h4>
      <ul>
        <li><span class="rule-num">1</span> Jawab 15 soal HOTS dari bank 40 soal — dipilih acak setiap sesi.</li>
