        <li><span class="rule-num">3</span> Power-up: <strong>50:50</strong>, <strong>Petunjuk</strong>, <strong>Lewati</strong> (masing-masing 1×).</li>
        <li><span class="rule-num">4</span> Raih <strong>Achievement</strong> dan taklukkan peringkat <strong>Arkeolog Muda</strong>!</li>
